<dt>Australia, Canada, Denmark, India, Indonesia, Iraq, Israel, Italy, Kuwait, Libya, Nowegia, Oman, Saudi Arabia, Korea Selatan, Tunisia, Qatar, United Kingdom, dan Amerika Serikat.</dt>
</dl>
